  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NIBIO RESILIENCE Climate Adaptation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A climate change adaptation project to build resilience of small farmers in two states of India (Assam &amp; Odisha) to replicate the postitive experience gained in Climarice and ClimaAdapt Projects.</narrative>
  </description>
